{"version":1,"key":"card:139","content":{"id":139,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Antd 的 Popover 的显示与隐藏有两种模式：受控模式和非受控模式，当我们主动设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"open","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"undefined","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，就是受控模式，反之不设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"open","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，或者设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"undefined","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时就是非受控模式。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// 非受控模式\n<Popover\n\ttrigger={'click'}\n  content={'Hello World!'}\n>\n  <Button>点我</Button>\n</Popover>","language":"TSX","uuid":"ceccc2bc-aa34-450c-b942-ed013156243f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// 受控模式\n<Popover\n\topen={open}\n  content={'Hello World!'}\n>\n  <Button>点我</Button>\n</Popover>","language":"tsx","uuid":"d832bed8-1d50-408e-94e3-42cae402a04a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在非受控模式下，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Popover","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的显示与隐藏遵循默认的规则，移入或点击元素时显示内容（受 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"trigger","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 控制），移出或点击别处时则隐藏，这个默认行为是极好的，但是有的时候，我们需要主动的控制显示和隐藏，一些默认的行为需要手动去实现，比如点击别处时隐藏卡片内容。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个实现的思路就是在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"document","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上监听点击事件，如果点击的元素不是卡片上的元素，我们就隐藏"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const Content = () => {\n  const ref = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n  \n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handleClickAway = (e) => {\n      if (ref.current && !ref.current.contans(e.target)) {\n        // 关闭弹窗\n      }\n    }\n    document.addEventListener('click', handleClickAway);\n    \n    return () => {\n      document.removeEventListener('click', handleClickAway);\n    }\n  }, [])\n  \n  return (\n  \t<div ref={ref}>\n      Hello World!\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\n<Popover\n\topen={open}\n  content={<Content />}\n>\n  点我\n</Popover>","language":"tsx","uuid":"9d7e7b3c-31a4-47dd-8b6b-5571145e2bc1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是奇怪之处在于，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"handleClickAway","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 并没有触发，让我百思不得其解，后面我把 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"document","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 换成了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"document.body","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，事件就触发了"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const Content = () => {\n  const ref = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n  \n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handleClickAway = (e) => {\n      if (ref.current && !ref.current.contans(e.target)) {\n        // 关闭弹窗\n      }\n    }\n    // 此处换成 document.body\n    document.body.addEventListener('click', handleClickAway);\n    \n    return () => {\n      document.body.removeEventListener('click', handleClickAway);\n    }\n  }, [])\n  \n  return (\n  \t<div ref={ref}>\n      Hello World!\n    </div>\n  )\n}","language":"tsx","uuid":"657a394a-eeae-48eb-9b49-8ebf19707e08","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"ahook","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"useClickAway","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"hook","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，用法为"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"useClickAway(fn, ref)","language":"tsx","uuid":"3e957dfe-9ac8-4ec9-b638-098aa6648f61","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当点击的地方在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ref","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之外，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"fn","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就会触发，我尝试用这个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"hook","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 去关闭弹窗，但是也没用，估计它监听的也是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"document","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的事件。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const Content = () => {\n  const ref = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n  \n  useClickAway(() => {\n    // 关闭弹窗\n  }, ref)\n  \n  return (\n  \t<div ref={ref}>\n      Hello World!\n    </div>\n  )\n}","language":"tsx","uuid":"8217403e-8135-48cd-8c09-75366084b454","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的问题出现在我的工作项目中，可能是谁在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"document.body","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上阻止了事件冒泡。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"divide-line","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"补充："},{"type":"formatted","text":"Popover","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 支持传递一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"onOpenChange","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的方法，当点击 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Popover","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 外部时会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"onOpenChange","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并且传递参数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"false","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示关闭，因此也可以传递 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"onOpenChange","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，既可以受控，又可以享受原来已有的功能"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const [open, setOpen] = useState(false);\n\n<Popover\n\topen={open}\n  onOpenChange={setOpen}\n>\n  <div></div>  \n</Popover>","language":"JSX","uuid":"8ccc7471-a767-416a-95a5-5c8e52bccdae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["技巧/React","React/antd","React/技巧","antd/Popover"],"createTime":1689599964006,"updateTime":1744171687642,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744171687642}}